  "selection_policy": "Frozen before model changes and before model predictions: second independent Block-1 holdout. Use the first eight official train documents from fiction and voyage in splits.md order, all two official dev documents from each genre as validation, and all two official test documents from each genre as test. Whole documents are groups. The prior news/interview pilot and the first academic/conversation frozen experiment are excluded. No document is selected or removed using model scores, errors, or predictions.",
